#. fr: Si vous commencez la quête “L'instinct combatif” maintenant, l'arme des Manderville que vous pourrez fabriquer sera celle <if ($gn4 == 0)><if ($gn68 == 5)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 6)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 7)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 10)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 11)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 14)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 26)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 27)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 28)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 33)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else>de <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if><else><if ($gn68 == 5)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 6)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 7)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 10)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 11)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 14)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 26)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 27)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 28)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else><if ($gn68 == 33)>d'<sheet ClassJob $gn68 2><else>de <sheet ClassJob $gn68 2></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if>.
